wildos-report (0.1.6) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Right-clicking the title, time and description boxes gives Cut, Copy
    and Paste.
  * Open GitHub says what it is doing while the browser opens, then what
    to do there: sign in, drag in the report and submit the issue. Once
    the issue appears on GitHub the window says so, with its number, and
    that it is safe to close. To find it, Report a problem reads GitHub's
    public list of new issues for up to half an hour, without signing in
    and without sending anything.

 -- Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>  Sat, 14 Nov 2026 07:54:43 +0000

wildos-report (0.1.5) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Report a problem can attach pictures already on the PC, such as an
    earlier screenshot, with Choose a picture beside Take a screenshot.
    Each is added as a fresh copy with no location, camera details or
    file name in it, as a new screenshot is.

